# Four players on level 2 start 150 points short of an extra life. The runs of players 1 and 4 take 250 points, cross 10,000 and
# gain a life, so they have six lives. Players 2 and 3 run left into the egg and the gap, take 100 points, cross nothing, and
# have five. After five rounds players 2 and 3 are out. Player 1's sixth death then hands the turn to player 4, skipping both.
# The script ends while player 4 plays its last life, because the original then starts a new game at once while the port waits at game over.
